gsfil:** Opprett en JSON-fil ved siden av datamodellene dine (`navn.cs` og `navn.schema.json`) som følger navnekonvensjonen `navn.validation.json` (f.eks. `skjema.validation.json`) [1].\n\n**2. Bruk standardstruktur i filen:** Filen skal initialiseres med `$schema`, `\"validations\"` og `\"definitions\"` [1]:\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://altinncdn.no/toolkits/altinn-app-frontend/4/schemas/json/validation/validation.schema.v1.json\",\n  \"validations\": {},\n  \"definitions\": {}\n}\n```\n\n**3. Legge til regler i `\"validations\"`:** Oppgi datamodell-stien for det aktuelle feltet som nøkkel…", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-studio-07-validering-uttrykk-fil", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 439, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-studio,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d221250e04c48 R20.4 P2.7 h2.0 or1.0 L2491 1/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.1,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.2,0.0] +q | Expression validation", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "59fc6201428d", :enrichment-hits 50, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8359, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "59fc6201428d", :expected-chunk-ids "59fc6201428d", :elapsed-ms 267669, :issued-queries "egendefinert validering med uttrykk utenfor studio designer datamodel validationexpression | studio designer datamodel validationexpression | custom validation expression Altinn Studio", :timestamp "2026-06-09T23:58:53.276837Z", :total-tokens 8798, :run-id "9a66bf1f-9e82-48fe-9ef7-8a18594f4b43", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "For å motta hendelser fra Altinn Correspondence må du sette opp et abonnementsendepunkt der publiserer hendelsene som leveres til [1]. Detaljerte trinn for selve registreringen av abonnementet finner du i dokumentasjonen om Hendelsesabonnement [1], men det overordnede kravet er at du abonnerer på den gitte ressursen for meldingstjenesten [1].\n\nNår konfigurerer abonnementsendepunktet som **mottaker**, må følgende filtre være satt opp:\n- `resourceFilter` → `\"urn:altinn:resource:\" + Ressurs-IDen for meldingstjenesten` [1]\n- `subjectFilter` → `\"urn:altinn:organization:identifier-no:{{recipient_orgnumber}}\"` [1]\n\n*SubjectFilter brukes til å begrense hendelsen kun den autoriserte mottakeren, noe som sikrer innholdet og reduserer synligheten for andre parter [1]. I tillegg kan du velge å bruke `t…", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-corr-01-events-webhook-subscription", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 428, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-correspondence,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d7a010952d7b4 R18.0 P3.6 h3.0 or1.3 L6240 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Events", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 7, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "50da0cfe12bd", :enrichment-hits 33, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8191, :pool-head "ddabe88fb244e R24.0 P2.5 h2.0 or1.2 L5909 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Events ;; d99b415acaa9e R21.2 P2.4 h2.0 or0.9 L1317 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questio