der", :timestamp "2026-06-10T00:02:50.263777Z", :total-tokens 8869, :run-id "66d8cebd-59cd-43bc-b3d7-d8494dd67ccf", :golden-display-rank 11, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Based on the provided context:\n\n- **SMS dispatch time:** SMS notifications are only delivered within a daily window of **09:00 to 17:00** [1]. If the scheduled send time falls outside this period, the notification is delayed and will be sent the following day instead [1].\n  \n- **Reminder timing (*revarsel*):** The exact trigger for an unread reminder depends on the environment scope described in the documentation. \n  - In production (the default description), a reminder is sent after **7 days** if the message has not been read [1].\n  - In test and staging environments, this interval is currently reduced to **1 day** due to temporary service limitations, though development plans note an eventual return to a 1-hour window for those environments [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? false, :question-id "ue-corr-04-notification-order-sms-window", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 494, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-correspondence,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "da960f8906327 R12.7 P3.6 h3.0 or1.3 L10384 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Notifications", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 24, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "9c58e66b93a3;7adf9cfcafc5", :enrichment-hits 35, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8369, :pool-head "d233db9c21941 R20.2 P2.5 h2.0 or0.6 L10147 0/? ty:conten