der `httpMethod` for handlingen ikke er `GET`, men et annet HTTP-metode (typisk POST) som skal utføre tilstandsendrende operasjoner [1, 3]. Mens vanlige nettleserbaserte sluttbrukersystemer som bruker GUI-handlinger standard kun tillater leseoperasjoner og navigering via GET-forespørsler på grunn av sikkerhetsrestriksjoner i nettlesere, er skrivehandlinger et unntak spesifikt designet for å håndtere slike tilstandsendringer direkte fra klienten [1].\n\n**Hvordan de lar GUI-handlinger endre tilstand uten full sidenavigering:**\nTeknisk lages dette opp gjennom flere samsvarende me…", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-06-skrivehandlinger", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 445, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d67fe7ac02e27 R24.1 P3.7 h3.0 or1.2 L3428 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.1,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.1,0.0] +q | Write actions", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "a46f90022fde;5776302a60da;e961e8f69c5b", :enrichment-hits 47, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 6746, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "a46f90022fde;e961e8f69c5b", :expected-chunk-ids "a46f90022fde", :elapsed-ms 192206, :issued-queries "skrivehandlinger dialogport | write actions dialog port state without navigation | dialogporten gui handlinger endre tilstand", :timestamp "2026-06-10T00:15:54.330451Z", :total-tokens 7191, :run-id "c1b79b62-c63c-4cad-943b-c6c913946931", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :